### Obtain Keycloak access token
POST {{tokenEndpoint}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=fundify&username= {{admin.username}}&password={{admin.password}}

> {% client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.access_token) %}


### Update permissions of user
@userId = e5bb35a2-7825-4c57-ac3b-dea484c3e26c
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

# Roles: oneOf: FUNDER | ADMIN | ANNOTATOR | EXTERNAL_API_CLIENT
{
  "roles": ["ANNOTATOR"],
  "affiliationId": "univie"
}
